+### `open_mcp_resource_link`
+
+Explicitly open a listed MCP resource link from this server after the user asks to read or inspect it. Pass the exact server and URI; links are never fetched automatically.
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "server": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Configured MCP server name."
+    },
+    "uri": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Exact resource URI supplied by the named server."
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "server",
+    "uri"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/mcp/mcp-resources/src/tools.ts`](../packages/mcp/mcp-resources/src/tools.ts)
